          "short": "$(6+6\\pi)\\text{ m}$\n\nAdd two semicircular arcs and two sides of $3\\text{ m}$.",
          "worked": "Each vertical side is a radius: $6\\div2=3\\text{ m}$. The dashed lines are construction lines and do not form part of the perimeter.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P&=2\\times3+2\\times\\left(\\frac12\\pi\\times6\\right)\\\\P&=(6+6\\pi)\\text{ m}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
